{"id":"1f927fd79207edda","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-boldface-projective-set.md","title":"ZFC Boldface Projective Set","display":"df-zfc-boldface-projective-set — ZFC Boldface Projective Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-boldface-projective-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-boldface-projective-set"],"display":"df-zfc-boldface-projective-set — ZFC Boldface Projective Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-boldface-projective-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-boldface-projective-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-boldface-projective-set — ZFC Boldface Projective Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c8a8e761d3e8227\" href=\"?note=8c8a8e761d3e8227\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S\\)</span> (boldface projective-set predicate on Baire space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8a8e761d3e8227\" href=\"?note=8c8a8e761d3e8227\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoldfaceProjectiveSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{BoldfaceProjectiveSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}boldface\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoldfaceProjectiveSet}_S(A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}boldface\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoldfaceProjectiveSet}_S(A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream predicate is already the boldface hierarchy: its pointclasses allow real parameters. This atom is therefore a typed alias, not a second incompatible hierarchy.</li>\n<li>The former dependency named projective modules and did not define projective pointclasses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8a8e761d3e8227","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8a8e761d3e8227","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S$ (boldface projective-set predicate on Baire space, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math"